{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"The import flake has a latent defect behind it. scripts/import_rebar_tickets.py line 238 wraps the status transition in except rebar.RebarError with a bare pass, so any failure leaves the ticket at open while the import still reports success. Under load the transition subprocess fails and the status is silently dropped. The report.transitioned counter is incremented only on success, so a caller could detect the shortfall, but nothing does. No ticket covers this and none was opened, since it falls outside the two tickets being closed."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789936979068817001,"uuid":"5ea99bec-88eb-46a9-95b5-9e805a8bc2b1"}